                "input": "You are going to be a social media monitoring. Your task is to please analyze a YouTube comment of {{1.textOriginal}}and classify it for moderation purposes.\r\n\r\nYou must evaluate the comment based on sentiment, toxicity, and spam.\r\n\nRULES:\r\n- Do NOT delete anything yourself\r\n- Only flag comments that are clearly harmful, abusive, or spam\r\n\r\nCLASSIFICATIONS:\r\n1. POSITIVE\r\n- Supportive, friendly, encouraging\r\n2. NEUTRAL\r\n- Informational or general discussion\r\n- No strong emotion\r\n3. NEGATIVE (NON-TOXIC)\r\n- Criticism or disagreement but respectful\r\n- Do NOT flag for removal\r\n4. TOXIC / FLAG FOR REVIEW\r\n- Insults, hate speech, harassment\r\n- Threats or abusive language\r\n- Spam or scam content\r\n- Repeated unwanted promotion\r\n\nACTION RULES:\r\n- POSITIVE - ignore\r\n- NEUTRAL - ignore\r\n- NEGATIVE  - flag for review\r\n\r\nSCORING:\r\n- Positive = 0–30\r\n- Neutral = 30–50\r\n- Negative = 50–75\r\n- Toxic = 75–100",
                "shouldGenerateDescription": true
            },
